1. Open MT Manager
2. Tap The Discord APK
3. Tap View
4. Select classes.dex
5. Tap Dex Editor
6. Tap String Pool
7. Tap 3 dots In The Top Right Of The Screen
8. Tap Filter
9. Search email
10. Change Email To Login String
11. Save The Dex File
12. Open ApkToolM
13. Tap Modified Discord APK
14. Select Remove Signature Verification
15. Rename dc-patched.apk
NOTE: 2.9.1 to v48 Only
